    "collapsible_content_XXQJTH": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_fDbDYg": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "STRUGGLE WELL",
            "icon": "chat_bubble",
            "row_content": "<p>Struggle Well is a prevention-focused program based on the science of Posttraumatic Growth. By partnering with first responder agencies and active serving military units, we’re fundamentally changing the culture from the inside-out.</p><p><a href=\"https://bouldercrest.org/program/struggle-well/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://bouldercrest.org/program/struggle-well/\">https://bouldercrest.org/program/struggle-well/</a></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_fkVQwC": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "WARRIOR PATHH",
            "icon": "chat_bubble",
            "row_content": "<p>Warrior PATHH provides the training you need to transform your struggle into strength and thrive in the aftermath of trauma. Warrior PATHH — Progressive and Alternative Training for Helping Heroes — is based on the science of Posttraumatic Growth (PTG).</p><p><a href=\"https://bouldercrest.org/program/warrior-pathh/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://bouldercrest.org/program/warrior-pathh/\">https://bouldercrest.org/program/warrior-pathh/</a></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_Xmnn6b": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "FIRST H.E.L.P",
            "icon": "chat_bubble",
            "row_content": "<p>Providing family support, spreading awareness and training resources for first responders.</p><p><a href=\"https://1sthelp.org/family-support/\">https://1sthelp.org/family-support/</a></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_NkKUaA": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "FIRST RESPONDER SUPPORT NETWORK",
            "icon": "chat_bubble",
            "row_content": "<p>Our goal is to provide first responders and their partners with tools to reduce the effects of traumatic stress and develop resiliency.</p><p>Call: (415) 721-9789</p><p><a href=\"https://www.frsn.org/\">https://www.frsn.org/</a></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
